{
  "format": "srwb",
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T15:53:21.085Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "Prolog 生成 ClojureScript：编译器演示",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "python",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 9,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Prolog 生成 ClojureScript\n\n本工作簿演示了 UnifyWeaver 如何将 Prolog 谓词编译为 **ClojureScript**，并通过 Scittle 内核在浏览器中执行结果。\n\n工作流程：\n1. 定义 Prolog 谓词（事实 + 规则）\n2. UnifyWeaver 检测递归模式（传递闭包）\n3. ClojureScript 目标生成可在浏览器中运行的 CLJS 代码（在 `atom` 映射上进行广度优先搜索 BFS、内嵌事实、无 JVM 互操作）\n4. 将生成的定义写入独立的高亮 ClojureScript 单元格中\n5. 在持久的 Scittle 上下文中运行独立的带语法高亮查询单元格\n\n目录会自动随本工作簿安装所需的 **UnifyWeaver SciREPL** 软件包。\n\n**优良特性：** 与 TypR 演示不同，ClojureScript 状态*在单元格之间保持持久* — Scittle 在每个页面维护一个 SCI 上下文 — 因此生成的定义与查询保持清晰分离。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "% 加载 UnifyWeaver 编译器模块\n['../init'].\n:- use_module(unifyweaver(targets/clojurescript_target)).\n:- use_module(unifyweaver(core/recursive_compiler)).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "load_compiler",
        "lastOutput": "Cannot find file: ../init",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Cannot find file: ../init</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "% 将家谱定义为 Prolog 事实\n:- dynamic parent/2, ancestor/2.\n\nparent(alice, bob).\nparent(bob, charlie).\nparent(bob, diana).\nparent(charlie, eve).\nparent(diana, frank).\n\n% 传递闭包: 如果 X 是 Y 的祖先，则 ancestor(X, Y)\nancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).\nancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Z), ancestor(Z, Y).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "family_tree",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "% 将 ancestor/2 仅编译为 ClojureScript 定义\n\\+ \\+ (\n    recursive_compiler:compile_recursive(ancestor/2, [target(clojurescript)], _Code),\n    format('--- Generated ClojureScript code ---~n~w~n', [_Code]),\n    % 以 nil 结尾，避免生成的种子表达式成为笔记本输出\n    format(string(_Definitions), '~w~n~nnil~n', [_Code]),\n    user:nb_write('cljs_output', '.code', _Definitions),\n    writeln('ClojureScript definitions written to cell: cljs_output')\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "compile_to_clojurescript",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: recursive_compiler:compile_recursive/3",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: recursive_compiler:compile_recursive/3</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "## 生成的 ClojureScript 代码\n\n下面的单元格仅包含由 UnifyWeaver 生成的 ClojureScript 定义。\n它包括：\n- `(def base-relation (atom {}))` — 作为可变映射的关系\n- `find-all` / `check-path` — 基于该关系的广度优先搜索 (BFS)\n- 从 Prolog 事实内嵌的种子 `(add-fact ...)` 调用\n- 仅使用 JS 宿主互操作（无 `java.io`、`System/exit` 或 `*command-line-args*`）\n\n接下来的高亮单元格将查询这些持久定义。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": ";; 此单元格将由编译器填充。\n;; 请先运行上方的 'compile_to_clojurescript' 单元格。",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "clojurescript",
        "name": "cljs_output",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": ";; 在 Scittle 的持久上下文中查询生成的定义。\n(print (str \"alice 的后代: \" (pr-str (sort (find-all \"alice\"))) \"\\n\"\n            \"alice 是 eve 的祖先: \" (check-path \"alice\" \"eve\") \"\\n\"\n            \"alice 是 frank 的祖先: \" (check-path \"alice\" \"frank\") \"\\n\"))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "clojurescript",
        "name": "cljs_queries",
        "lastOutput": "Could not resolve symbol: find-all",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Could not resolve symbol: find-all</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "## 对比：相同谓词的 JVM Clojure 目标\n\nUnifyWeaver 也可以为 JVM Clojure 编译相同的谓词。该输出从标准输入读取事实并使用 `System/exit` — 这非常适合 JVM/Node 宿主环境，但无法直接在浏览器中运行。这正是 ClojureScript 目标存在的原因（它将 JVM 宿主互操作重写为 JS）。",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "% 将相同谓词编译为 JVM Clojure 进行对比（仅显示）\n\\+ \\+ (\n    recursive_compiler:compile_recursive(ancestor/2, [target(clojure)], _ClojureCode),\n    format('--- Generated JVM Clojure code (note java.io / *command-line-args*) ---~n~w~n', [_ClojureCode])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "compile_to_clojure",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: recursive_compiler:compile_recursive/3",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: recursive_compiler:compile_recursive/3</pre>"
      }
    ]
  }
}